{%- set first = variants.0 -%}
# {{ theme.name }} Neovim Theme

Neovim colorscheme for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

### lazy.nvim

Point lazy.nvim at this directory:

```lua
{
    dir = "/path/to/this/directory",
    config = function()
        require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({ variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}" })
        vim.cmd.colorscheme("{{ theme.id }}")
    end,
}
```

## Options

```lua
require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({
    variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}",{% if variants | length > 1 %} --{% for v in variants %} "{{ v.variant.id }}"{% if not loop.last %} or{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}
})
```

